fixed by 1f8da406a964 ("srcu: Prevent redundant __srcu_read_unlock()
wakeup").  Another related commit is 340170fef01b ("rcutorture: Suppress
pi-lock-across read-unlock testing for Tiny SRCU").

							Thanx, Paul

